# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Env — never commit tokens
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Curator scratch output (regenerated every run)
curator-report.md
review-comment.md
.curate-prompt.md

# Astro build cache and generated types — never committed
.astro/

# Third-party skill installs. `npx skills add <repo>` drops copies into these
# per-harness directories; they are tooling, not part of this product, and
# committing a third-party skill's binary and 2 MB catalog into an awesome list
# would be both a licence problem and noise for every visitor.
.agents/
.claude/
agent/
data/skills/
skills-lock.json

# Design review captures — regenerate with `node scripts/shoot.mjs`
.impeccable/review/

# NOTE: docs/, llms.txt, llms-full.txt, skill.md and projects.json are generated
# but ARE committed on purpose:
#   - docs/ is the GitHub Pages source for the website,
#   - skill.md / llms*.txt are what `npx skills add` and model fetches read.
# The workflows rebuild and commit them, and CI fails if they drift from the data file.